# 🏛️ Historical Places of Maharashtra

A responsive and informative website showcasing the famous historical landmarks of Maharashtra, India. This project aims to highlight culturally and historically significant sites like Ajanta Caves, Raigad Fort, and Bibi Ka Maqbara through a clean and user-friendly interface.

---

## 🌟 Features

- 📍 **Interactive Map** – Easily locate historical sites across Maharashtra  
- 🏯 **Detailed Place Pages** – Each location includes a brief description, image, and significance  
- 🌐 **External Links** – Direct access to official tourism or heritage sites for more information  
- 📱 **Responsive Design** – Works well on both desktop and mobile devices  
- 🎨 **Modern UI** – Clean layout, smooth navigation, and visual consistency

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Frontend:** HTML5, CSS3  
- **Map Integration:** Google Maps Embed / iframe  
- **Design:** Responsive grid and flexbox layouts  
- **No backend required** – Fully static website  

---

## 🎯 Purpose

This project was developed as a portfolio piece to demonstrate basic web development skills while promoting cultural education. It is ideal for students, tourists, and history enthusiasts exploring Maharashtra’s architectural and historical legacy.

